  "pli-tv-kd7:1.3.1": "",
  "pli-tv-kd7:1.3.2": "For an explanation of rendering <i lang='pi' translate='no'>kathina</i> as “robe-making ceremony”, see Appendix of Technical Terms. ",
  "pli-tv-kd7:1.3.3": "",
  "pli-tv-kd7:1.3.4": "For the first four of these five see <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-bu-vb-pc46/en/brahmali#5.6.1'>Bu Pc 46:5.6.1</a>, <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-bu-vb-np2/en/brahmali#2.39.1'>Bu Np 2:2.39.1</a>, <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-bu-vb-pc32/en/brahmali#8.15.1'>Bu Pc 32:8.15.1</a>, and <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-bu-vb-np1/en/brahmali#2.17.1'>Bu Np 1:2.17.1</a> respectively. “Robe-cloth” renders <i lang='pi' translate='no'>cīvara</i>, for which see Appendix of Technical Terms. ",
